      "text": [
        "The Spirit station, at the top of the lattice. Echo Manifest turns Bound Echoes into **Manifested Ingots**, and ingots into **Resonant Cores**, the heart of the mod's best gear and machines."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Using it",
      "text": [
        "Place Echo Manifest with a Spirit totem within 8 blocks.",
        "- Bound Echo to Manifested Ingot: **5 seconds** at **32 Pulse a second**.",
        "- Manifested Ingot to Resonant Core: **8 seconds** at **40 Pulse a second**.",
        "Both are before pack settings.",
        "Cores unlock Greater Pulse Cells, Spiritgear, long-distance automation and gate keystones. Seated in a Pulse Resonator, a core is its strongest crystal."
      ]
